-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Number of observations           10,264   ->   8,581       
Number of variables                   4   ->   4           
j variable (2 values)              year   ->   (dropped)
xij variables:
                               val_prod   ->   val_prod2021 val_prod2022
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

. * continuing firms only
